<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbekistan May unemployment steady at 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Uzbekistan May unemployment steady at 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Uzbekistan totalled 42,200 people, or 0.5 percent of the workforce, at the end of May, versus 41,600 in April, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK UNEMPLOYMENT	  May 97     Apr 97     May 96</p>
<p>    officially registered     42,200     41,600     39,900</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce    0.5	  0.5	  0.4</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
